の他構図はお任せいたします。\n\n余裕がありましたらで構いませんので表情の差分もお願いします。\n\nキャラクターと背景と宛名を別レイヤーに分けていただけると助かります。\n\nTwitter等でのSNS利用、youtubeのサムネイル・配信・動画等への利用を許可いただきたいです。\nFANBOXの無料プランへの投稿もさせて欲しいです。\n\n是非よろしくおねがいします。\n\nチャンネル\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCLf-NIzqgDVtW32-G6zMfqQ\nTwitter\nhttps://twitter.com/Mahochang__\n資料\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/5z5Dc3tPTa1hgwLUA\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/5z5Dc3tPTa1hgwLUA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kei8987/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bcfc37f5/uploads/origins/8e07ca11-8f24-4af9-a011-e0cd1cf7ea1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d98e0e605b0e40adc114a60c906a8b5a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bcfc37f5/uploads/origins/8e07ca11-8f24-4af9-a011-e0cd1cf7ea1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d98e0e605b0e40adc114a60c906a8b5a, https://si.imgix.net/bcfc37f5/uploads/origins/8e07ca11-8f24-4af9-a011-e0cd1cf7ea1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=471b15218551081eac62160bf5677f9d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bcfc37f5/uploads/origins/8e07ca11-8f24-4af9-a011-e0cd1cf7ea1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ec7d8ef98442fba225d309921ebbe3c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ウマ娘のメジロアルダンちゃんお願いします！\n\n服：勝負服\n姿勢：\n全力疾走するメジロアルダン\nhttps://umamusume-umapyoi.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/iocsWkd.gif\n\nそれ以外はお任せいたします。\nどうぞよろしくお願い致します。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kei8987/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/21de7981/uploads/origins/aa1c34bb-2b2f-497e-bc78-c803528826aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ce8685e18d9355426be780fc3180b3a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/21de7981/uploads/origins/aa1c34bb-2b2f-497e-bc78-c803528826aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ce8685e18d9355426be780fc3180b3a, https://si.imgix.net/21de7981/uploads/origins/aa1c34bb-2b2f-497e-bc78-c803528826aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b7e4bf946cf4a8ac17d7bf9727792b0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/21de7981/uploads/origins/aa1c34bb-2b2f-497e-bc78-c803528826aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87127129d5c71c29bca9ed3db3b3588a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I love your art! The amount of detail you put into eyes really caught my attention.\n\nCan you draw VTuber Iekushi Chapipi ( https://twitter.com/IekushiChapipi )?\n\nChapipi is a computer virus and a bit of a brat, but also gets flustered and embarrassed easily! She can also sing very well. She's very talented and tries to provide a lot of variety! This includes being cute sometimes, cool other times, and seductive when she wants to be.\n\nCan you draw Chapipi in an outfit / pose similar to the reference below?\n\nThank you!\n\nCharacter References:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cz6MT87jRwLqZaC0_Xkww4AEprY8AIx1?usp=sharing\n\nOutfit / Pose reference:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1E2cbLDzUK71yyiFEdOOxlpjGGe0GZFdu/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kei8987/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2cdf82d0/uploads/origins/3e4a9efe-38a1-494f-97a1-f66d74697e66?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12e39a6e35a3f0d0ec3d5f942e0997f1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2cdf82d0/uploads/origins/3e4a9efe-38a1-494f-97a1-f66d74697e66?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12e39a6e35a3f0d0ec3d5f942e0997f1, https://si.imgix.net/2cdf82d0/uploads/origins/3e4a9efe-38a1-494f-97a1-f66d74697e66?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=783be92c3d5224fc0f3520fa921ac3a2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2cdf82d0/uploads/origins/3e4a9efe-38a1-494f-97a1-f66d74697e66?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=cr